1) what type of constructs should be supported?

and

2) has anybody a good idea on how to specify such constructs?

beside the fact that such a job is very difficult to program in tex i
judge the question of a good syntax even higher. some time ago (i
think on the german tex list) somebody asked for laying out plays.
finding a good input syntax for such tasks should be the first goal to
reach. i'm convinced that once that is done one could come up with an
implementation. so perhap this would be another task for the volunteer
list?

